WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.489
One fine day, a young farm girl walked to the market.

2
00:00:07.489 --> 00:00:10.735
Her name was Molly.

3
00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:16.267
On her head, she carried a pail of milk.

4
00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:19.748
"I am so excited!

5
00:00:19.748 --> 00:00:23.725
The market has so much to see!

6
00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:30.200
After I sell my milk, what should I buy?" she wondered.

7
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:36.628
"Hmm! Let me think!"

8
00:00:36.628 --> 00:00:41.031
But Molly had only one pail of milk.

9
00:00:41.031 --> 00:00:45.228
She could not sell it for a lot of money.

10
00:00:45.228 --> 00:00:53.331
"I will buy one hen," she decided.

11
00:00:53.331 --> 00:00:57.395
"What would I do with just one hen?

12
00:00:57.395 --> 00:01:01.933
One hen would lay many eggs.

13
00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:07.369
Then the eggs would hatch.

14
00:01:07.369 --> 00:01:13.881
What would I do with all the chicks?

15
00:01:13.881 --> 00:01:17.603
I would feed the chicks.

16
00:01:17.603 --> 00:01:21.191
They would grow large and healthy.

17
00:01:21.191 --> 00:01:24.661
Then they would lay more eggs.

18
00:01:24.661 --> 00:01:34.504
The eggs would hatch, and I would have more chicks!

19
00:01:34.504 --> 00:01:40.341
Oh yes! Then I would sell many eggs and chicks.

20
00:01:40.341 --> 00:01:44.872
People would come from all around to buy them.

21
00:01:44.872 --> 00:01:49.841
I would be rich!" Molly smiled.

22
00:01:49.841 --> 00:01:58.518
"I would buy beautiful clothes, golden pins for my hair, and shiny shoes.

23
00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:10.052
I would be the richest and most famous person in the village!

24
00:02:10.052 --> 00:02:14.916
One day, I would be invited to the palace.

25
00:02:14.916 --> 00:02:18.516
Everyone would envy me!

26
00:02:18.516 --> 00:02:22.762
I would meet a handsome prince.

27
00:02:22.762 --> 00:02:26.415
The prince would bow to me.

28
00:02:26.415 --> 00:02:30.298
And I would bow to him.

29
00:02:30.298 --> 00:02:36.219
I would say, 'Your Majesty,' and bow like this . . ."

30
00:02:36.219 --> 00:02:43.331
When Molly bowed, the pail fell from her head.

31
00:02:43.331 --> 00:02:46.436
The milk spilled everywhere.

32
00:02:46.436 --> 00:02:55.050
Molly cried and cried.

33
00:02:55.051 --> 00:02:57.287
The milk was gone.

34
00:02:57.287 --> 00:03:04.938
And Molly's dreams were gone too.

